# Cursor Rules - Mascarade

## Instruction Sources
- .github/copilot-instructions.md
- .github/instructions/core-python.instructions.md
- .github/instructions/api-hono.instructions.md
- .github/instructions/web-react.instructions.md
- .github/instructions/deploy.instructions.md
- .github/instructions/dev-environment.instructions.md

## Workspace Behavior
- Respect strict stack boundaries: core/, api/, web/.
- Keep patches minimal and focused to requested scope.
- Run stack-specific validation after each change.
- Prefer async I/O patterns in core Python code.
- Keep API middleware order stable: auth -> rate-limit -> CORS.

## Validation Shortcuts
- Core: cd core && python -m pytest && ruff check mascarade/ tests/
- API: cd api && npm run build && npm test
- Web: cd web && npm run build && npm test -- --run
